# NUN change log

## 0.1.0-phase-a (unreleased)

- Added a Multiboot2 x86_64 bootstrap that enters long mode with a temporary 1 GiB identity map.
- Added COM1 serial diagnostics and a version-independent early boot-information parser.
- Added an early 4 KiB physical-frame allocator that reserves the kernel, Multiboot2 information and boot modules.
- Added IDT exception stubs, legacy PIC remapping and a nominal 1 kHz PIT timer interrupt.
- Added a QEMU ISO build target and CI smoke test. QEMU boot status remains pending until the workflow succeeds on the branch.

Not included: production bootloader, higher-half VM, buddy/slab allocator, APIC, SMP, scheduler, userspace, filesystem, network, graphics, signed boot chain or non-x86_64 ports.
